Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:48.97,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:51.42,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:51.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:54.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:56.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:57.59,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:01.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:05.90,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:08.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.92,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:13.12,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:18.13,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:22.33,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:27.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:27.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:31.73,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:30.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:31.60,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:32.76,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:37.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:36.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:37.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:38.31,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:42.82,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:48.17,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:49.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:52.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:51.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:55.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.79,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:57.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:57.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:02:00.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:03.17,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:04.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
