Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.86,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.61,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:22.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:26.17,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:28.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yeah~！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:39.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,像椰子和果仁那般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,柔軟甜美的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:45.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,沉醉其中时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:47.35,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:50.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,得把窗帘打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,去寻找梦的续集
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.99,0:22:57.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,希望那灿烂的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:22:59.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,不要把我的心溶化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:00.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:06.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,太阳公公的表情多么开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:12.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为何可以笑得这么开怀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:18.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,其实我的心情也是同样明亮的 color
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:23.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮吧 My True Love！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.31,0:23:28.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:31.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:33.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.16,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:36.71,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:40.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
